{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10448","headline":"送蔡山人 · 高适","name":"送蔡山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山布衣明古今，自言独未逢知音。\n识者阅见一生事，到处豁然千里心。\n看书学劒长辛苦，近日方思谒明主。\n斗酒相留醉复醒，悲歌数年泪如雨。\n丈夫遭遇不可知，买臣主父皆如斯。\n我今蹭蹬无所似，看尔崩腾何若爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}